{"desc": "This Pattern was posted by stephakayyy. Tagged with: simple, material design, purple, pink, theme-switch, modern, colorful, pattern, modern, purple, colorful, abstract, contrast, geometric, decorative, pattern, repetitive, arcs.", "image": "/data/library-cache/files/8db111746b0b2fca07eb.jpg", "tailwind": false, "html": "<div class=\"container\"></div>\n", "css": ".container {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  --s: 100px; /* control the size */\n  --c1: #ff8afc;\n  --c2: #1b1b3a;\n\n  --_g: var(--c2) 6% 14%, var(--c1) 16% 24%, var(--c2) 26% 34%,\n    var(--c1) 36% 44%, var(--c2) 46% 54%, var(--c1) 56% 64%, var(--c2) 66% 74%,\n    var(--c1) 76% 84%, var(--c2) 86% 94%;\n  background: radial-gradient(\n      100% 100% at 100% 0,\n      var(--c1) 4%,\n      var(--_g),\n      #0008 96%,\n      #0000\n    ),\n    radial-gradient(\n        100% 100% at 0 100%,\n        #0000,\n        #0008 4%,\n        var(--_g),\n        var(--c1) 96%\n      )\n      var(--c1);\n  background-size: var(--s) var(--s);\n}\n", "license": "mit"}